1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:18,999
Glory be to the name of God. I offer a thousand thanks to Mother Mary and her Holy Son for choosing our sinful family to be a permanent witness of her apparition.

2
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,999
I took my covenant on the 15/03/2023.

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:30,999
Three months after that, I was given the opportunity to testify at this very altar where our Blessed Mother appeared.

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,999
Today, I have come back to this same altar to fulfill a promise I made back then.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:41,999
With gratitude for the blessings Mother obtained for me from Jesus,

6
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:53,999
I had ended my last testimony standing before her, saying that I would one day return to testify again—this time bringing my whole family and the key to our own home.

7
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,999
That is how I ended my testimony that day.

8
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:03,999
For 10 years, we had been living in a rented house.

9
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:09,999
In my first testimony, I had shared that we lost our property in a landslide.

10
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:18,999
But later, we received the necessary funds, and by God's grace, we were able to buy both land and a house.

11
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:24,999
While all our documents were being prepared, we were suddenly informed that something was again wrong with them.

12
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:32,999
That news put us in a very distressing situation. But I turned to Mother Mary and prayed.

13
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:36,999
I told her, “Mother, I’ve already testified at your altar.” People often ask me,

14
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:43,999
“You gave your testimony, right? Then why isn’t anything happening?” But we knew why.

15
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:51,999
Our family understood the reason too. It’s because initially, we had decided to purchase only land.

16
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:57,999
So when the funds came, the plan was to first buy land and then build a house on it.

17
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:03,999
But later, my husband and I came for the Rosary Rally here.

18
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:12,999
After the rally, we felt strongly that it would be better if we could get both land and house together, so the funds could be passed in one go.

19
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:18,999
That realization led us to revise our application and reapply.

20
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:26,999
That’s the reason for the delay. We never explained this to anyone. While we were waiting,

21
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:34,999
the process was moving forward—not because we knew anyone or had any influence—

22
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:40,999
but because every Tuesday and Wednesday, Mother would literally place the phone numbers of officials into my hands.

23
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:47,999
I contacted those people, and that’s how the application kept progressing.

24
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:51,999
We had to revise the application twice.

25
00:02:52,000 --> 00:03:01,999
The third time, I spoke with a Sister named Maria during a counseling session. She told me, “Submit the officials in prayer.

26
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:06,999
Only when we pray will their hands not make errors.”

27
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:10,999
So as a family, we prayed and offered up the officials in prayer.

28
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:19,999
One day, after attending Holy Mass, I remembered what Father always says during retreat:

29
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:24,999
“Everything I achieved was through the power of the Holy Mass I offered for 39 years.”

30
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:30,999
That day during Mass, I looked at the altar and prayed, “Mother, before and after our covenant,

31
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:36,999
not even a single day have I missed the Holy Mass. I come to your presence faithfully.

32
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:45,999
My son stands at the altar as an altar server. Even if not my prayer,

33
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:50,999
even if not my Mass, please accept at least one of my children’s Holy Masses. I need an answer today.

34
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:59,999
I knew it was Wednesday—Mother’s day. I always take a moment to pray on that day.

35
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:04,999
I prayed, “Mother, for years my children have lived in a rented house. Their biggest desire—

36
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:12,999
which they always tell me—is to build a small crib for Jesus on His birthday. But I never allowed it.

37
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:18,999
I didn’t want them building a crib in a rented house.

38
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:25,999
I had told Jesus along with my husband, ‘Please grant them the blessing to build it in a house of their own.’”

39
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:31,999
I looked up and prayed, “Mother, let there not be another Christmas without a decision. No more revisions.

40
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:35,999
Please make the fund approval happen.” I went home.

41
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:43,999
And just as always, something happened at the exact time of Mother’s apparition—around 2:30 p.m., I got a phone call.

42
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:50,999
It was from the Collectorate. They informed me, “Your entire fund has been passed together under the disaster relief scheme.”

43
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:56,999
I was overwhelmed with joy. Because there has never been a single request I’ve made at Jesus’ altar

44
00:04:57,000 --> 00:05:01,999
that He has not heard. Mother has always interceded faithfully. I wept with gratitude.

45
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:05,999
After that, the funds were passed. Now we had to find land.

46
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:10,999
Neither of us had much experience with choosing property. But I had one deep desire—

47
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:17,999
to find a place close to the church. So we didn’t look anywhere far.

48
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:22,999
We looked at several nearby places and almost finalized one with an advance, but it never went through.

49
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:25,999
Honestly, we were not giving advance payments just out of interest.

50
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:29,999
At each site, there was either no water or access was too difficult. Getting water itself was a serious issue. My

51
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:33,999
If there was one thing I struggled with the most in life, it was the issue of water.

52
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:40,999
Sometimes the only option would be pipe water, and we would end up paying ₹2000–₹3000 just for extra water.

53
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:45,999
There were days we had to pay ₹3000 for only ₹100. That’s how hard it was just for water.

54
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:50,999
Even then, we almost selected another property—but again, it didn’t have water.

55
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:56,999
Still, I told my husband, “Let’s at least be close to the church.” Even if there’s no water, we’ll find a way.

56
00:05:57,000 --> 00:06:02,999
Every time we tried to give an advance, something would block it.

57
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:10,999
Three different times we went to give an advance, and each time it didn’t work out.

58
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:15,999
One night, after returning home, my husband spoke to me.

59
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:21,999
He said, “Let’s stop searching just for land. Let’s look for a property that already has a house.

60
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,999
Our son is in 12th grade now.

61
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:28,999
Once his education is over, we may need to spend for college, and we might not be able to handle a big construction project.”

62
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:35,999
We were financially very tight. So he said, “Let’s just look for a house with land.”

63
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:42,999
The very next day, someone mentioned a property to us, and we went to see it.

64
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:48,999
We really liked it. Most importantly, it had its own well.

65
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:55,999
I didn’t tell anyone. I just called my elder sister to come and take a look.

66
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:59,999
I didn’t want too many opinions, so I didn’t call others.

67
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:05,999
After seeing it, my sister asked me, “What’s the one thing you’ve struggled with the most?”

68
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:11,999
I replied, “Water.” She said, “Then you don’t need to think twice.

69
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:16,999
Mother Mary has given you a house with a proper well and good water. Take it.”

70
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:22,999
Even though we returned home after liking the place, I felt deeply uneasy.

71
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:28,999
My husband liked it. Everyone liked it. But he told me,

72
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:32,999
“Only if you too have peace about it, we will proceed.”

73
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:36,999
But I was restless. I prayed to Mother Mary,

74
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:45,999
“Mother, we’ve only seen the place. But if you and Jesus feel this is truly meant for us, please make it happen.”

75
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:53,999
That night, I had a dream. I saw Mother Mary standing in the front porch of that house.

76
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:58,999
She said to me, “Didn’t I already ask my Son to give this to you? Why do you still doubt?

77
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:05,999
There are a few things that still need to be done. I will arrange all of it for you.”

78
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:14,999
Earlier, the day after I gave my first testimony here after taking the covenant, I had another dream.

79
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:19,999
I saw Mother Mary in a silver-gray color. She came to my house,

80
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:24,999
took me and my husband, and showed us a two-level property with stairs.

81
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:29,999
At that time, I hadn’t seen any house, but later I realized—

82
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:39,999
it was the same 7-cent plot we were now looking at. I had told my husband back then that Mother showed me this.

83
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:43,999
She had even shown a double-story house with a car porch next to it.

84
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:49,999
No other place we saw matched this. I began to wonder, “Was that dream really from Mother? Or just my imagination?”

85
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:58,999
Nine months later, this exact place came back to us, and everything started falling into place.

86
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:03,999
Before we finalized the agreement, we decided based on my husband’s wishes to go ahead.

87
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:16,999
We fixed May 21st as the agreement date. But we only had ₹4000 in hand, though we needed more for the agreement.

88
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:22,999
But Mother had already made a provision for me. Earlier, when I came here, I prayed,

89
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:28,999
“Mother, my highest education is 10th grade. With that, I don’t expect any job.

90
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:34,999
But You know my heart’s desire. If it is Your will, will You give me such a job?”

91
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:38,999
This wasn’t something I had included in my covenant. But after I left,

92
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:45,999
I was given an opportunity to care for an elderly woman. The family welcomed me warmly.

93
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:50,999
Her daughters didn’t see me as just a caretaker—they treated me like their own sibling.

94
00:09:51,000 --> 00:10:01,999
That much love they gave me. Even though the woman had a broken hand that was not healing, and surgery wouldn’t help—

95
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:09,999
ever since I came, and brought Mother’s covenant oil with me,

96
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:14,999
her hand, which she couldn't lift before, began improving.

97
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:20,999
Within two weeks, she could lift the bag that had been sitting there untouched.

98
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:27,999
The family was amazed. They said with joy, “Mother Mary sent you to us. You are a gift from her.”

99
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:34,999
Hearing that filled me with deep joy, because I no longer felt like a stranger in that home.

100
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:41,999
That moment, everything became clear to me. Even the others understood my situation and how I was seeking land. I realized — it was Mother Mary who was arranging all of this for me.

101
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:45,999
I felt in my heart that all this was happening because of her. So, we decided to offer whatever we could towards it. We fixed ₹50000 as the token amount.

102
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:52,999
Like I said before, we only had ₹4,000 in our account. Still, I told my husband, “Brother, let’s keep faith. Wednesday is Mother's day.”

103
00:10:53,000 --> 00:11:04,999
We fixed the agreement to be signed on that Wednesday at 2:30 PM. On that day, after bathing and taking care of the elderly woman I was caring for

104
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:12,999
we went there at 2:30 PM. Though we had planned to give just a small amount, by Mother’s grace we were able to hand over ₹75,000 for the agreement.

105
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:21,999
Even now, when I stand at the altar and share this testimony, many people ask, “How did that money come?” We don’t know either — it was a miracle.

106
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:31,999
Hearing testimonies like this, even I used to think, “Lord, will I ever see such a miracle in my life?” And then, this happened — the ₹75,000 became possible, just as I had hoped.

107
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:42,999
My sister, who is in the UK — her name is Emily — was overjoyed. She and others in the family were very eager and kept calling, offering help from all sides.

108
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:54,999
With their support, we managed to pay the ₹75,000. Honestly, our agreement was that the full payment would be made by July or August 30, after which we would receive the house key.

109
00:11:55,000 --> 00:12:09,999
Then came the time to renew my covenant (udampadi). So, last month, on the 4th, I came here and renewed it. I never delay covenant renewal — even when no outward change seems to be happening.

110
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:21,999
We always tell our family, “Wait — we’ll receive the anointing oil, and then things will happen.” That’s the truth — this anointing oil is so powerful that I can’t stop sharing testimonies.

111
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:30,999
That’s why I came again — to submit my intentions (niyogangal). When I got there, I had my agreement papers in hand.

112
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:42,999
I placed them at Mother Mary’s feet and prayed, “Mother, the land You and Your Son gave us — You know what else is needed. Please arrange everything.”

113
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:55,999
I placed the papers in her hands and continued, “Mother, I’ll go ahead and flatten mountains, break iron gates, and shatter bronze doors — as the Lord promised Israel, He will be with me.”

114
00:12:56,000 --> 00:13:03,999
Holding onto that promise, I asked, “Mother, please make all the arrangements.” After renewing my covenant, I returned home.

115
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:11,999
On the sixth day after that, I went and bought seven bundles of faith newspapers. Why seven? Because Mother gave me seven cents of land.

116
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:18,999
As the priest says in retreats, “If Jesus blesses you with something, what will you do in return?” That question stuck with me. I decided to buy seven bundles in gratitude and faith.

117
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:26,999
The priest always asks this question: “If Jesus gives you something good, what meaningful thing will you do in return?”

118
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:32,999
During my prayer time, I said I would buy seven bundles of leaflets because He gave me seven cents of land.

119
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:37,999
I don’t just give those seven bundles of leaflets at random places or churches. That was a decision I made when I took the covenant.

120
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:41,999
I remembered how Jesus went up the mountain to preach the Gospel…

121
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:47,999
…and I truly love going from house to house. Because I feared if I just left the newsletters in public places, people might throw them away.

122
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:51,999
That fear stayed with me. So from the day I took the covenant, whenever I visited a house…

123
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:58,999
…I would take the newsletters, mark it with a cross, recite the Creed, and pray: “Mother Mary, please ask Jesus to show me the land meant for me.”

124
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:04,999
And that land would be revealed to me. I would go to those hills, those houses…

125
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:12,999
…where many people were waiting for me. They might not even know they were waiting, but they were. Because this newsletters guides people on how to enter the covenant.

126
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:16,999
Some of them were non-Christians too. But I speak boldly to everyone. I tell them about Mother Mary…

127
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:20,999
…and about the blessings I received. I have even given testimony on this altar before.

128
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:25,999
I tell everything and hand them the newsletters. They receive it with joy. That’s how…

129
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:32,999
…while handing out those seven bundles of newsletters, only about five bundles went to Christian families.

130
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:39,999
The rest I gave to Muslim families. But when they asked me for the leaflet, I felt such joy.

131
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:46,999
They would say, “This newsletters shows the wonders Mother Mary works. Daughter, please give us one.” I would give it and ask…

132
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:51,999
“Will you read it?” And they would say, “Yes, why wouldn’t we? What are you saying, dear?”

133
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:57,999
Even if they said they wouldn’t read it, I later saw them sitting and reading it. Only after seeing that would I leave the house.

134
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:02,999
Some children eagerly asked me, “Sister, yesterday we saw a testimony… is it really true?”

135
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:08,999
I said, “Yes, what you saw yesterday is real.” Then they said, “Sister, it’s such a miracle that you came to us today.”

136
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:13,999
When they called her Beebi, I said, “It’s Mother Mary who brought me here.”

137
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:20,999
That’s how I kept giving out the newletters. After all seven bundles were finished, a miracle came—Mother Mary gave me a gift.

138
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:27,999
I told you about the fund approval too, right? Even though the fund reached the Collector’s office from Thamarassery…

139
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:33,999
…for us to receive the money, we had to find land and a house and submit all the documents.

140
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:39,999
They said we’d have to go back to the Collector again. But I kept asking and understood better. Then I quickly…

141
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:45,999
…prayed to Mother Mary: “Please shorten all this. Finish it soon. We can’t keep going back and forth anymore.”

142
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:52,999
She said so, and Mother took care of the land and all the arrangements, doing everything necessary for me.

143
00:15:53,000 --> 00:16:02,999
Then on June 28th, our ownership was officially registered. That document became our proof and the key to the house.

144
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:08,999
That’s why we stand here at this altar, remembering and thanking the blessings Mother has given us.

145
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:15,999
When I took the covenant with Mother, Joseph Father always said, “Mother will never forget anything.” Likewise, when I took the covenant,

146
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:21,999
I wrote in the covenant book that by May 28th, Mother would give me a house and land of my own. I wrote this with a pencil.

147
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:30,999
The day after that agreement, I asked Mother, “Is this really true? Will you give me a sign?” While going for evening prayer,

148
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:40,999
Mother told me to take the covenant book. When I took it, I opened the prayer for apparitions, and she said it would happen by May 28th.

149
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:47,999
She told me to check the calendar and asked, “Isn’t Mother’s apparition on the 21st and 28th? I gave you the seven.”

150
00:16:48,000 --> 00:17:01,999
She asked, “Why don’t you believe it?” I apologized, “Mother, thank you for all the blessings you gave me.” Then I spoke about my husband’s illness.

151
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:07,999
My husband had a stroke, as I mentioned earlier. Then Mother’s elder brother had terrible hip pain.

152
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:17,999
When he told the doctor about the back pain, the doctor said if he took even a slight fall, he would be bedridden. Hearing this,

153
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:33,999
I felt deep sorrow because the head of the family was incapacitated. I told Mother, “Doctor said this and that,” but this is Mother’s covenant.

154
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:43,999
I decided with Mother that we would follow her decision. We collected medicine from the doctor and came home, but the pain didn’t go away.

155
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:53,999
hip pain was unbearable; those around him couldn’t even carry him to a vehicle.

156
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:58,999
He couldn’t even breathe properly. It was a terrible distress because there were many things to be done the next day.

157
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:05,999
I felt deeply distressed about this illness but didn’t say anything. After everything was done fresh, at evening prayer,

158
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:13,999
I said many people got healed by applying the covenant oil. I testified to this myself. Many people told me, “Keep testifying, keep telling.”

159
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:24,999
I told Mother, “If after applying this covenant oil my husband’s hip pain doesn’t improve, then I am taking this covenant oil for that purpose.”

160
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:28,999
Mother you know that. By the power of this anointing oil, my husband’s…

161
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:33,999
The hip pain completely disappeared. The next day, my husband had to go to work, so after prayer,

162
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:39,999
I marked a cross on his hip, and the very next day, my husband went to work without any hip pain,

163
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:48,999
and he continues to work well even today. No matter what pain there is, I told him to keep Mother’s blue cloth carefully wrapped,

164
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:54,999
and I applied the anointing oil on him before he went to work. There are always some risks, but I said,

165
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:59,999
“The covenant will not necessarily make everything perfect, but Mother’s protection, this Holy Trinity's protection,

166
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:04,999
will be with us.” No matter the hardships, those streets where my husband walks are protected.

167
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:11,999
Many dangers came afterward, but if you ask how Mother protected us from all those dangers,

168
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:17,999
it’s in a way that words can’t explain. This altar and my husband being with me today is a blessing Mother got from Jesus.

169
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:25,999
My husband was saved from very big dangers by that grace.

170
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:34,999
Then about my daughter — she had severe stomach pain, an awful and burning stomach pain. Even after going to mass,

171
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:40,999
they said it was stomach pain and did all the scans, but there was no problem found. Still, for a month, whenever she went to mass,

172
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:46,999
she would start complaining of terrible stomach pain. The sisters said she just needs to come with Mother to church,

173
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:52,999
saying it’s stomach pain to her son and then leaving. It was very hard for me; even with treatment and scans, nothing was found,

174
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:59,999
but it was stomach pain. At night, my husband said to me, “Isn’t that the covenant oil you hold? Apply the covenant oil on her

175
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:05,999
and pray; she’ll get better by tomorrow.” Even though I argued a little, I marked a cross on her stomach and prayed,

176
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:11,999
“Mother, please take this away. Please give her healing, whatever it is.”

177
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:18,999
That night, Mother came near her in a dream, in silver-grey covered with roses.

178
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:25,999
Jesus the Holy Trinity was standing behind her. She dreamed that her stomach was being held and protected.

179
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:33,999
Since then, that stomach pain has never returned. Also, she was very backward in her studies — she couldn’t remember anything she studied.

180
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:39,999
I put this in the covenant and told Mother, “Please arrange everything for her studies.”

181
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:46,999
This time she passed from eighth to ninth grade, even though it was difficult. Even though she struggles with everything,

182
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:54,999
I told Mother about this and that her faith would increase. She also gives out four or five newsletters to her friends,

183
00:20:55,000 --> 00:20:58,999
and I prayed that the power of this would give them success.

184
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:06,999
When I came, I prayed that they would receive the grace to pass from eighth to ninth grade.

185
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:10,999
She was blessed. That day when she took the word, she told me,

186
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:15,999
“Even if everyone abandons you, I will never abandon you,” Jesus gave me that promise. That promise brought me great joy

187
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:21,999
because that promise deeply settled in her heart. So I believed she trusted that word more than her success.

188
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:28,999
Likewise, when my son Sabin was taking his 10th grade exams, I came here and renewed the covenant.

189
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:35,999
I said, “Mother, please bless my son and grant him the success you intend for him. You know what I desire.”

190
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:41,999
I don’t know his qualifications, but Mother stood with him and helped him take the exams.

191
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:47,999
Though he is not weak in class and the teachers are eager about his studies,

192
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:53,999
he told me, “Mom, I’ll handle math and English; I will do everything.

193
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:59,999
I make sure all my work is correct, but when I combine the answers at the end, I make mistakes. That’s where my marks suffer.”

194
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:03,999
When he went to the exam, I prayed to Mother. While he was in the exam hall,

195
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:10,999
I recited a thousand beads rosaries from our parish church and prayed for him, his friends, and everyone there.

196
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:16,999
He took many exams, and for all of them, I prayed a thousand beads rosaries. Mother and the Holy Virgin blessed him

197
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:21,999
with nine A+ grades in the S.S.L.C. I thank Mother and the Holy Trrinity for that.

198
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:26,999
For all his successes, whether he passes the exam or others, he always asks me only one thing:

199
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:34,999
“Mom, you must sit and pray the rosary.” When I asked if Mother is sitting and praying rosary here while I am at the exam hall, he would go.

200
00:22:35,000 --> 00:22:40,999
I gave him salt and oil, applied it, prayed for him, and prepared him. Mother grants him grace to pass everything.

201
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:47,999
Likewise, when the USS exam results came, there was some obstacle preventing him from receiving the benefits. The teacher informed me,

202
00:22:48,000 --> 00:22:56,999
and similarly, he applied for another scholarship, which also got delayed. They were very upset. Given our situation,

203
00:22:57,000 --> 00:23:01,999
it is beneficial that we get it. I told the teachers about it. They said they would check with us.

204
00:23:02,000 --> 00:23:10,999
They came, and I prayed according to the appointment given. He received those benefits.

205
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:13,999
Then this is my child’s testimony.

206
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:20,999
She also had severe stomach pain, which seemed viral stomach pain. They told me to do a scan,

207
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:25,999
but I didn’t go for any scans. I applied the covenant oil and prayed. It completely healed.

208
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:32,999
I also put in the covenant that she had allergy problems. Those allergy issues also healed later.

209
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:37,999
I am talking about a health issue I had. When I first heard the testimony about my throat,

210
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:44,999
there was a sound like a blockage. After that, when we went for tests, the doctor said the place

211
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:50,999
where the sound was coming from had closed up. He said I should rest for at least two or three months,

212
00:23:51,000 --> 00:23:55,999
do physiotherapy, and so on. But I kept going back and forth.

213
00:23:56,000 --> 00:24:01,999
I got the medicine but didn’t take it. I applied the oil and prayed. When the oil told me not to speak,

214
00:24:02,000 --> 00:24:07,999
I asked myself what I could do. Everyone was honest with me and said that Kreupasanam is what saves me.

215
00:24:08,000 --> 00:24:13,999
When I came into Kreupasanam, they had many doubts. Everyone asked me what I needed to do for the covenant.

216
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:20,999
I spoke beyond what I knew well. That’s why the doctor said I shouldn’t talk much. Because of that,

217
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:24,999
the sound eventually disappeared. Even after all that, I told myself I would not speak,

218
00:24:25,000 --> 00:24:32,999
but when someone asked me about doubts, if I talked about Jesus and Mother Mary, I would talk endlessly.

219
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:39,999
Even when they told me to do physiotherapy and such, still, because of applying the covenant oil and praying,

220
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:46,999
the problem in my throat was completely removed by Mother Mary. Today, my throat has no issues at all,

221
00:24:47,000 --> 00:24:52,999
and I have never taken any medicine. We thank Mother, Jesus for all these blessings and graces.

222
00:24:53,000 --> 00:25:00,999
We thank them a thousand times and end here. Book of Deuteronomy Chapter 33 Verse 3

223
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:06,999
There, He loved His people, His holy ones, all in their hands.

224
00:25:07,000 --> 00:25:14,999
They were in their paths, and they listened to His word. This is a great testimony for the family of Sini Sajin.

225
00:25:15,000 --> 00:25:22,999
It is a great manifestation and testimony of a big family. Many miracles happened in their lives.

226
00:25:23,000 --> 00:25:29,999
Sini said, when they prayed for a house, the Holy Mother herself intervened. She gave them the house and land.

227
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:38,999
In return, they gave seven bundles of newsletters for seven cents of land.

228
00:25:39,000 --> 00:25:44,999
Similarly, the prayer they made to Jesus to get it, “Because of the merit of my mass, you must grant me this.”

229
00:25:45,000 --> 00:25:52,999
Also, when they participated in the rosary rally, they had a big experience. Time was extended,

230
00:25:53,000 --> 00:25:58,999
but the mother is the one who shortens time. But when some things take longer, Joseph Father used to say,

231
00:25:59,000 --> 00:26:06,999
“That blessing will be great.” Their blessing was very great. When they desired a house and land,

232
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:12,999
the family members who worked in the house helped a lot. We have the closeness of the Holy Mother in many ways.

233
00:26:13,000 --> 00:26:18,999
In many personal situations, we are sure to receive blessings when we hold the covenant. That is what this

234
00:26:19,000 --> 00:26:24,999
sister here is telling us. Through dreams, she and her children were constantly visited—

235
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:32,999
a great blessing for them. Similarly, her husband's back pain was completely healed

236
00:26:33,000 --> 00:26:37,999
by the holy oil of Jesus, as the sister here testifies.

237
00:26:38,000 --> 00:26:43,999
The greatest and most beautiful testimony the sister shared is this: I come here

238
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:49,999
to take the covenant so that I may receive the holy oil. Everyone who takes the covenant

239
00:26:50,000 --> 00:26:55,999
knows we are not allowed to distribute holy items to others. Perhaps during the classes

240
00:26:56,000 --> 00:27:01,999
when we renew the covenant or take it for the first time, we must pay close attention,

241
00:27:02,000 --> 00:27:06,999
otherwise, if we distribute the covenant items, people won’t know how to use them. Because

242
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:12,999
only the covenant holders can activate these items, as Joseph Father always reminds us.

243
00:27:13,000 --> 00:27:19,999
So we must be very careful, properly use our covenant items, and remind others how to use them.

244
00:27:20,000 --> 00:27:24,999
We offer this testimony as a good hand of blessings given by Jesus and the Holy Mother

245
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:33,999
to the family of Sini Saji. Such extraordinary divine experiences—now to you as well—

246
00:27:34,000 --> 00:27:40,999
if you haven’t subscribed to this YouTube channel yet, please do so now. Share this video with your friends

247
00:27:41,000 --> 00:27:45,000
and become a messenger of the Lord.
